<metadata><name>Day 48 - Swiss Meadows, Loree, Intercept</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.504973" lon="-80.331780"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking along the north side of Maple Lane. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.513080" lon="-80.374850"><name>P2 alternative parking</name><desc>Official off road parking area on the north shoulder of 21st Sideroad, offered by the Town of…. Fee unclear. Joins the route near km 7.3 (1700 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.503967" lon="-80.330112"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed Swiss Meadows Side Trail, heading south-east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.503652" lon="-80.337877"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn left onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.511539" lon="-80.355352"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed Intercept Side Trail, heading south-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.510776" lon="-80.357298"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: End of the Intercept Side Trail. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.512082" lon="-80.363863"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed Loree Side Trail, heading south. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.507356" lon="-80.373715"><name>J6</name><desc>J6: Turnaround point. The side trail meets the white-blazed main Bruce Trail here. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
